  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using imagenet_vit_l as the image encoder (config_009) outperforms resnet50 (config_001). This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder from scvi_n200 (config_009) to pca_n2000 while keeping the image encoder, aggregation (avgpool), and fusion (weighted) the same isolates the impact of RNA representation. This clarifies whether RNA encoder choice is critical, balancing exploration of key design decisions with exploitation of the promising image encoder."
